# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository regardless of the
# platform's checkout settings. This keeps diffs reviewable: a full-file
# CRLF<->LF rewrite shows up as noise and hides real changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never attempt text conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.epub binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.heapsnapshot binary

# Windows-only build files stay LF in the repo; the toolchain reads LF fine
# and eol=lf keeps the working tree identical on every platform.
